# Written by Kone Tshivhinda (Claude Opus 5.5) on 2026-09-25 — Repository ignore rules for the polyglot monorepo; lockfiles are never ignored (P0)
#
# Lockfiles are COMMITTED on purpose (INSTRUCTIONS §6 rule 5; AI_COMMUNICATION MSG-005):
#   Cargo.lock · go.sum · go.work.sum · pnpm-lock.yaml · uv.lock · gradle.lockfile · mix.lock ·
#   .terraform.lock.hcl. Do not add any of them (or *.lock) here.
# scripts/validate-compliance.py fails the build if a file excluded here is tracked anyway.

# ── Secrets & environment (INSTRUCTIONS §9.10, §10 #4) ────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
.secrets
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
cosign.key
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
.terraform/
crash.log
crash.*.log

# ── Local engineer identity profiles (INSTRUCTIONS §1.4) ──────────────────────
docs/engineers/*
!docs/engineers/.gitkeep

# ── Java / Gradle ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.gradle/
build/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
out/
*.class
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*
.kotlin/

# ── Kotlin / Android (edge/field-app) ─────────────────────────────────────────
local.properties
captures/
.cxx/
.externalNativeBuild/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex

